    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "id": "9h8i4ep",
      "content": "Midwifery and Obstetrical Nursing deals with the care of women during pregnancy, labor, childbirth, and the postpartum period. It also includes care of the newborn. In nursing competitive examinations such as RRB Nursing, questions frequently come from stages of pregnancy, antenatal care, stages of labor, complications of pregnancy, and postnatal care."
    },
